OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers at first across
OL,6,FShetland, otherwise a dry and bright
OL,7,Fmorning. Cloud will thicken through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, with outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fspreading northwards into Orkney later
OL,10,Fin the afternoon. A few showers still
OL,11,Ffor Shetland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will continue to
OL,14,Fthicken with outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fspreading north through the evening.
OL,16,FRain will become more persistent
OL,17,Fovernight and turn heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
