OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,6,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain,
OL,7,Fbecoming quite persistent in places
OL,8,Fand turning heavy at times. Freshening
OL,9,Feast to northeast winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Wednesday with outbreaks of
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain, perhaps
OL,14,Fturning drier later. Drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter on Thursday and Friday with
OL,16,Fthe risk of a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
